WEBVTT

1
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:47,840
When they get down, they can only retreat.

2
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:58,180
The wolf may come again

3
00:00:58,460 --> 00:01:20,400
Not possible

4
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,600
I'll deal with the Wolf King and the others

5
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:24,830
Leave the rest to me and that vixen

6
00:01:27,890 --> 00:01:29,090
Since you are in a hurry to reincarnate

7
00:01:29,490 --> 00:01:30,650
Then I will send it to a city
